    title: "No more Losing Potential customers",
    description: "<strong>87% of businesses</strong> lose customers by not following up on a lead within 5 minutes. Your new system solves this for you without taking up your time."
  },
  {
    title: "Proven Effective Website Formula",
    description: "After designing hundreds of websites and systems, we help you with a website sales machine that works while you sleep."
  },
  {
    title: "Let your system handle it all",
    description: "The Your Web Club system helps you automate your business and communications with your customers so you can focus on your job."
  },
  {
    title: "Fixes the marketing Gaps",
    description: "Most leads for local businesses slip through the cracks and either forget about you or go to your competitors."
  },
  {
